{"id":2344,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><style></style><div><p>暮春的中北校园，草木葱茏，暖风拂面，处处洋溢着青春的朝气。2026年4月25日为期两天的学校春季运动会圆满落下帷幕。机械工程学院全体运动健儿在各项赛事中乘风破浪、屡创佳绩，最终斩获团体总分第三名的优异成绩，续写了属于机械学子的荣誉诗篇。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YMmv4anRU8nmMRL87lYM7r7MmG4U4-i4M7n7nNLZUz9sUN-0gihFp2hmCIa0nShRokhVoSyiM4-sLmCYUzVkMR-Yn7CioR-ZUmUanz6VLmnFLRlsnRUZL8WFLlW7M4-JqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4MRCZMYbw62D8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34687&e=.jpeg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/EC8E95727262A1B422DF5828B40E7E24/057D483B/1BD72\" vheight=\" 498px\" vwidth=\" 552px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YMmv4anRU8nmMRL87lYM7r7MmG4U4-i4M7n7nNLZUz9sUN-0gihFp2hmCIa0nShRokhVoSyiM4-sLmCYUzVkMR-Yn7CioR-ZUmUanz6VLmnFLRlsnRUZL8WFLlW7M4-JqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4MRCZMYbw62D8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34687&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>开幕式上，我院方阵意气风发，迈着整齐有力的步伐走过主席台，少年们身姿挺拔、神采飞扬，尽显工科学子的昂扬锐气，与春日美景相融，成为赛场上一道鲜活的风景。</p><p>赛场上的每一刻，都写满了热血与坚守。从径赛到田赛，机械学子奋勇争先，在多项赛事中摘得荣誉，如在三级跳、男子跳远、太行烽火线(200m军事障碍跑)以及混合滚轮胎接力赛等项目中斩获金牌；在女子跳高、铅球、跨栏等项目中均赢得数枚奖牌；此外在立定团体跳、4*400接力赛、20*50接力赛等团体赛中也取得极为优异的成绩。他们用行动诠释着拼搏的意义。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Ynzf42nmnVnmUsU8mMVo7MRMRlDMlVifLmnfL4GYnmTRU8U0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyPLYyPL1yaUNQRn7Q7LmLaU4CYnllPnNQ2nlLiMNlPMlQFnmQVL8UanzMFLz-Do7UJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4MRCZMYbw62D8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34687&e=.jpeg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/113120BFCDFD230C62EE1FFFEC56E15F/F6E3D0E3/1268D\" vheight=\" 526px\" vwidth=\" 459px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Ynzf42nmnVnmUsU8mMVo7MRMRlDMlVifLmnfL4GYnmTRU8U0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyPLYyPL1yaUNQRn7Q7LmLaU4CYnllPnNQ2nlLiMNlPMlQFnmQVL8UanzMFLz-Do7UJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4MRCZMYbw62D8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34687&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>赛场之外，温暖始终相伴。学院老师全程守候，为运动员加油鼓劲、贴心叮嘱；后勤同学们忙碌奔波，做好各项保障工作；啦啦队的呐喊声此起彼伏，化作赛场上最有力的支撑，师生同心的温暖，让这份荣誉更有分量。</p><p>两天的赛场时光，有冲刺的热血，有坚持的感动，更有团结的力量。这份赛场上的拼搏精神，也将融入每一位机械学子的日常。未来，大家必将带着这份热血与韧劲，在学习生活中勇毅前行，续写更多属于机械工程学院的荣光！</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YLRV4RUzAVoR9in8R98UNQkLNM7L7LiDMl7DoRlbnRA7oRU0gihFp2hmCIa0okyDnSyDMSy8MRCDozN8nRWfLmCiMRrVLlnVMzQVLlL8oRnFMmT7Mz-DMRMFLlrVnz7JqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4MRCZMYbw62D8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34687&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/86E654466994D2A26545E1DE56E1C484/69D52643/1EEE1\" vheight=\" 327px\" vwidth=\" 633px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YLRV4RUzAVoR9in8R98UNQkLNM7L7LiDMl7DoRlbnRA7oRU0gihFp2hmCIa0okyDnSyDMSy8MRCDozN8nRWfLmCiMRrVLlnVMzQVLlL8oRnFMmT7Mz-DMRMFLlrVnz7JqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4MRCZMYbw62D8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34687&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>一审一校 王怡宁</p><p>二审二校 王浩然</p><p>三审三校 李宗霖</p></div></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=YMmv4anRU8nmMRL87lYM7r7MmG4U4-i4M7n7nNLZUz9sUN-0gihFp2hmCIa0nShRokhVoSyiM4-sLmCYUzVkMR-Yn7CioR-ZUmUanz6VLmnFLRlsnRUZL8WFLlW7M4-JqjfTQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4MRCZMYbw62D8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=34687&e=.jpeg"}